[2.186769,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  A protected host behind each router\r\n  ===================================\r\n\r\n  Here is our lab: this Ze initiates to a hidden Ze responder.\r\n  10.78.1.2 and 10.78.2.2 are behind different routers.\r\n  No VPN is configured on this router yet.\r\n\r\n  In Junos terms, IKE authenticates the gateway and IPsec SAs\r\n  protect the traffic. We will inspect both, then test real packets.\r\n"]
